OL,3,GNEWSAAccelerant poured on house in
OL,4,Aarson attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice are investigating an arson
OL,7,Fattack in north Belfast after an
OL,8,Faccelerant was poured onto the windows
OL,9,Fof a house and set alight.
OL,11,FThe incident happened in the Halliday's
OL,12,FRoad area shortly before 22:00 BST on
OL,13,FThursday.
OL,15,FThe Northern Ireland Fire and Rescue
OL,16,FService and police were at the the
OL,17,Fscene and the fire was extinguished.
OL,19,FPolice said the incident is being
OL,20,Ftreated as arson with intent to
OL,21,Fendanger life.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
